I've been trying to figure out a strategy for getting the Amulet of Yendor away
from the Wiz without having to kill him. I know one can polymorph into a 
nymph and steel it from him, but I'd prefer avoiding that. It occurred to me
that I could zap him with a teleport ray while he was sleeping on the Amulet.
He and the amulet would be separately teleported to other random parts of the
maze. I then would use an object detect potion or crystal ball to locate the
amulet. Then I teleport myself to where it is, grab it, and head for the
stairway, using paralysis potions to slow the Wiz down. then I'm out of that
level and free from the Wiz's random attacks and item-cursing. Can anyone out
there test out this strategy? Maybe someone on a mac or PC whose copying his
save files?

Some other miscellaneous questions:
What is the lowest AC a character may have before value wrap-around occurs?
 My guy is at AC -48 on NH 3.0j on a Sun machine...

Is there a maximum number of items that can be put in a bag o'holding before 
something terrible happens, esp. when using the curse/bless bug to expand its
capacity?

What items should not go in a bag o' holding?
